     "general",
     "socket buffer below the minimum (4096 kB) at 1 of 3 points:\n         remote-app (vr_server) @ metallica: 416 kB\n       What overflows the queue becomes 'loss' in the report without being loss at the UPF -- and if it\n       remains on one side only, the comparison between the paths reflects a difference of loss, not of path.\n       Run ON THE NODE (they are global sysctls; the container does not see them):\n         sudo sysctl -w net.core.rmem_max=16777216 net.core.wmem_max=16777216\n       To keep it after a reboot, write it to /etc/sysctl.d/99-tg2-vr.conf. On the core nodes (petshopboys, metallica),\n       where there is no sudo, the way out is to lower the load profile until both sides lose equally."
    ]
